WEBVTT

00:06.790 --> 00:08.770
<i>I-I'm so tired...</i>

00:09.130 --> 00:12.180
<i>I've been working too much 
overtime this month.</i>

00:12.660 --> 00:15.030
<i>I need to get home so I can sleep.</i>

00:19.610 --> 00:20.880
I can't keep going...

00:21.240 --> 00:23.660
I'm heading straight to bed.

00:32.290 --> 00:34.170
<i>H-Huh?</i>

00:35.140 --> 00:37.040
<i>M-My body...</i>

00:38.430 --> 00:41.180
<i>Am I... dying?</i>

00:42.250 --> 00:45.630
<i>I'm Midori Akitsu, and I'm 27 years old.</i>

00:46.470 --> 00:49.250
<i>My life was a short one...</i>

00:52.440 --> 00:55.850
I can't believe I worked 
myself to death. This sucks.

00:56.430 --> 00:59.340
No one's here for my final moments.

00:59.990 --> 01:02.370
I didn't even get to say goodbye to my parents.

01:03.190 --> 01:06.590
I don't want to die like this!

01:07.220 --> 01:09.030
Would you like me to intervene?

01:09.290 --> 01:10.430
Huh?

01:12.810 --> 01:16.280
Your lifespan is fixed, 
so that can't be changed,

01:16.280 --> 01:19.960
but if you help me, I'll change how you die.

01:20.310 --> 01:22.370
How I die?

01:22.370 --> 01:25.720
Wait, are you... God?

01:26.460 --> 01:27.300
Yes.

01:27.860 --> 01:35.190
Humans are currently persecuting other 
species in a world known as Asdyllon.

01:35.190 --> 01:37.870
I'd like to reincarnate you there

01:37.870 --> 01:41.120
so you can decide if the humans
should be wiped out.

01:41.900 --> 01:43.080
Wait, what?!

01:43.080 --> 01:45.960
I don't think I can help you 
with something like that...

01:45.960 --> 01:49.030
In exchange, I'll grant you a special power.

01:49.030 --> 01:50.770
A special power?

01:50.770 --> 01:55.260
Is there anything you want, 
like teleportation or killer abilities?

01:57.920 --> 01:58.720
Fluff...

01:59.060 --> 01:59.820
Huh?

01:59.820 --> 02:01.500
I wanna pet fluffy things!

02:01.500 --> 02:03.250
Wh-What?

02:04.290 --> 02:12.950
I've been dying to pet my 
parents' kitty <i>foreeeeever</i>!

02:12.950 --> 02:21.120
I want the healing power of stroking
 that silky fur all day long!

02:21.410 --> 02:27.950
Petting fluffy animals is the only 
thing that soothes my exhausted heart!

02:28.630 --> 02:33.140
I'm not sure I understand, 
but that'll be your special power.

02:33.140 --> 02:33.680
Huh?

02:34.000 --> 02:37.320
I'll make it so creatures 
other than humans like you.

02:37.690 --> 02:39.140
What? H-Hang on!

02:39.610 --> 02:41.590
Well, thanks for helping out!

02:41.890 --> 02:45.730
W-Wait! I haven't agreed to anything yet!

02:46.350 --> 02:49.080
Hey, wait!

03:09.960 --> 03:12.970
Oh, the baby's awake!

03:12.510 --> 03:15.360
<i>What in the world happened?</i>

03:12.970 --> 03:14.830
Father, look!

03:14.830 --> 03:19.120
Shh. The naming will be over soon.

03:15.360 --> 03:19.120
<i>I can't speak, and I can't move my body...</i>

03:19.360 --> 03:21.850
Her name will be Nefertima.

03:21.850 --> 03:23.900
Nefertima Osphe.

03:29.230 --> 03:30.940
Nefertima...

03:30.940 --> 03:32.530
I'll call her Neema!

03:33.980 --> 03:37.490
There, there. Are you hungry?

03:37.800 --> 03:39.200
She's so cute!

03:39.200 --> 03:41.980
Nice to meet you, Neema.

03:39.200 --> 03:41.980
<i>I... really...</i>

03:44.010 --> 03:45.990
<i>I've really been reincarnated?!</i>

03:54.830 --> 03:59.710
<b><i>Fluffy Paradise</i></b>

05:16.330 --> 05:21.340
<b><i>Episode 1   Nobody Told Me This Would Happen!</i></b>

05:16.850 --> 05:23.060
<i>Larshia, the largest of Asdyllon's three 
continents, is home to the Kingdom of Gaché.</i>

05:23.560 --> 05:31.470
<i>I was reincarnated there as Nefertima, 
third born to the royal ducal family of Osphe.</i>

05:31.800 --> 05:34.660
<i>As for my family in this world...</i>

05:37.240 --> 05:40.300
Neema, congratulations on turning three.

05:40.300 --> 05:42.570
<i>There's my gentlemanly older brother, Ralf.</i>

05:43.810 --> 05:45.520
Here's a spell to celebrate!

05:45.520 --> 05:47.390
Isn't it pretty, like fireworks?

05:47.390 --> 05:49.400
<i>My energetic older sister, Karna.</i>

05:49.740 --> 05:52.880
<i>My beautiful mother and kind father...</i>

05:52.870 --> 05:56.330
<b>Lovey</b>

05:53.790 --> 05:56.330
<i>Although Papa can be a bit disappointing.</i>

05:56.750 --> 05:57.800
<i>And finally...</i>

06:00.490 --> 06:01.200
Neema!

06:03.250 --> 06:04.460
Dee!

06:05.750 --> 06:09.930
<i>There's my beloved dog, Dee, 
who's always there to save me.</i>

06:10.200 --> 06:13.610
<i>I eat, sleep, get coddled by my family,
 and pet fluffy animals.</i>

06:14.180 --> 06:16.390
<i>My life is the best!</i>

06:16.610 --> 06:20.860
My, my. Neema is always 
surrounded by animals.

06:21.120 --> 06:23.590
<i>Thank you, God!</i>

06:25.870 --> 06:26.790
Neema!

06:28.080 --> 06:32.080
<i>But maybe I shouldn't pet
 the animals </i>too<i> much.</i>

06:38.530 --> 06:40.220
The royal palace?

06:40.220 --> 06:45.170
Yes. I have to go there for work, 
but I don't know what to do.

06:45.410 --> 06:49.710
Your father is working, 
and Ralf and Karna are at the academy.

06:51.980 --> 06:56.100
Animals aren't allowed at the royal 
palace, so I can't take Dee.

06:56.410 --> 06:59.160
Can you be a good girl for me, Neema?

06:59.160 --> 07:00.310
Yeah!

07:00.630 --> 07:04.710
<i>All right! I get to leave the house!</i>

07:12.570 --> 07:15.890
<i>Everyone's so cheerful and lively,</i>

07:16.850 --> 07:19.340
<i>but they all seem so peaceful.</i>

07:20.470 --> 07:25.770
<i>They don't look like people 
who'd persecute others.</i>

07:28.190 --> 07:30.910
You're sure you'll be okay all by yourself?

07:30.910 --> 07:32.260
Yeah!

07:32.950 --> 07:34.390
All right, then.

07:38.300 --> 07:40.720
I put a protective spell on you.

07:41.310 --> 07:43.270
Be a good girl and wait for me, okay?

07:50.120 --> 07:52.110
<i>I'm bored.</i>

08:06.370 --> 08:08.390
Wait! Wait for me!

08:17.190 --> 08:20.290
<i>Oh, wow! The royal palace rules.</i>

08:20.290 --> 08:22.640
<i>It's a fluffy paradise!</i>

08:27.300 --> 08:28.480
Huh? What?

08:47.190 --> 08:49.680
<i>Heck yes! A rare fluff!</i>

08:51.620 --> 08:55.830
<i>I-I want to touch it. Is it okay to pet it?</i>

09:00.090 --> 09:02.720
Hey, that tickles!

09:03.360 --> 09:05.930
Take this! Squeezed you back!

09:07.730 --> 09:09.350
<i>So fluffy!</i>

09:09.660 --> 09:12.330
<i>How is it so silky and fluffy?</i>

09:12.730 --> 09:15.520
<i>This fluff must be super rare!</i>

09:23.050 --> 09:24.780
Huh? Can I ride on your back?

09:30.560 --> 09:32.160
How pretty!

09:33.940 --> 09:36.130
What's that on your back, Lars?

09:39.600 --> 09:41.850
Lars may be well-behaved, 
but he's still a beast.

09:41.850 --> 09:43.300
Get down. It's dangerous.

09:43.300 --> 09:45.310
<i>Where'd this beautiful boy come from?</i>

09:50.180 --> 09:51.730
Come on, now.

09:52.050 --> 09:55.190
No! Put me down!

09:56.350 --> 09:58.660
How's this, then?

10:01.020 --> 10:02.630
Let go!

10:02.630 --> 10:04.620
<i>What is this brute doing?!</i>

10:09.840 --> 10:11.110
Thank you!

10:12.130 --> 10:15.080
It's rare for Lars to take to 
anyone other than me.

10:15.550 --> 10:17.370
Hey, where are your parents?

10:17.370 --> 10:19.840
What's a kid doing out here?

10:19.840 --> 10:22.060
Mom is working.

10:22.510 --> 10:23.510
What's your name?

10:27.470 --> 10:30.640
Nefertima Osphe. I'm three years old.

10:31.880 --> 10:33.620
You're from the Osphe family, huh?

10:35.170 --> 10:36.100
Come with me.

10:45.960 --> 10:47.240
Pardon me.

10:50.360 --> 10:51.410
Neema?

10:51.410 --> 10:52.700
Dad!

10:52.700 --> 10:53.630
Why are you here?

10:57.080 --> 10:58.840
<i>That's the prince's...</i>

10:58.840 --> 11:02.560
She seemed lost, Duke Osphe,
so I brought her to you.

11:02.560 --> 11:04.640
Not lost!

11:04.640 --> 11:07.360
I rescued her while she was 
playing with Lars in the yard.

11:07.800 --> 11:08.510
What?

11:09.270 --> 11:12.200
Neema, tell me what happened.

11:12.200 --> 11:13.980
I came here with Mom.

11:14.320 --> 11:18.440
I was lonely by myself, 
and then Lars played with me!

11:19.140 --> 11:20.290
Neema...

11:20.660 --> 11:23.270
I see. You were lonely, were you?

11:23.270 --> 11:25.100
I'm so, so sorry.

11:24.000 --> 11:25.530
Owie, ow...

11:25.530 --> 11:29.130
Your Highness, thank you 
for bringing Neema to me.

11:32.160 --> 11:33.670
<i>"Y-Your Highness"?</i>

11:33.670 --> 11:38.280
<i>You're telling me this brute is a prince?!</i>

11:39.500 --> 11:42.800
Come, now, Neema. Thank the prince.

11:45.130 --> 11:47.720
Th-Thank you...

11:53.740 --> 11:55.810
So polite for such a little girl.

11:55.810 --> 11:57.660
S-Stop it!

11:57.660 --> 11:59.400
Is that your youngest daughter?

11:59.400 --> 12:00.520
Yes.

12:01.290 --> 12:04.580
<i>Wait, does that mean this man is...</i>

12:04.840 --> 12:07.730
<i>Okay, I should put on a show for him.</i>

12:08.250 --> 12:10.760
I'm Nefertima Osphe.

12:10.760 --> 12:12.700
I just turned three.

12:13.080 --> 12:16.040
My, my. What a good girl.

12:17.920 --> 12:19.890
Do you like Lars?

12:19.890 --> 12:21.120
We're friends!

12:21.370 --> 12:24.050
I am Gauldi Russ Gaché.

12:24.050 --> 12:25.880
I'm the king of this nation.

12:26.250 --> 12:27.850
You're welcome to visit again.

12:28.120 --> 12:30.240
Thanks, Mister King!

12:31.740 --> 12:33.270
What's the meaning of this?

12:34.320 --> 12:36.780
I can't believe you ran off on your own.

12:36.780 --> 12:38.980
Do you have any idea how worried I was?

12:39.250 --> 12:41.040
I'm sowwie.

12:41.040 --> 12:43.430
Not only that, but you were 
riding the sky tiger?

12:43.760 --> 12:45.140
Sky tiger?

12:45.650 --> 12:47.550
She's talking about Lars.

12:48.630 --> 12:53.180
Me and Lars are friends! He protected me!

12:53.180 --> 12:54.900
Can I visit him again?

12:54.900 --> 12:57.110
The king invited me back.

12:57.760 --> 13:00.960
You're hopeless... But very well.

13:00.960 --> 13:03.750
Just promise me this.

13:03.750 --> 13:05.190
Promise?

13:05.190 --> 13:08.930
You mustn't visit the sky tiger 
when anyone's watching.

13:08.930 --> 13:13.520
He's a holy beast who uses 
elemental power. He's special.

13:13.520 --> 13:15.190
Elemental power?

13:15.190 --> 13:16.150
That's right.

13:16.150 --> 13:19.940
Our spells draw on our mana,

13:20.320 --> 13:25.020
but spirits use the divine power
 that fills our world.

13:25.020 --> 13:28.770
Using that energy is known as elementalism.

13:28.770 --> 13:34.640
Typically, holy beasts only grow attached 
to the master with whom they bond.

13:35.460 --> 13:38.060
But Lars is my friend.

13:38.430 --> 13:41.480
I wanna see him and pet him...

13:41.480 --> 13:45.230
I know. But that's why you have to promise

13:45.230 --> 13:49.070
not to go see him while 
others are around. Okay?

13:49.070 --> 13:50.000
Okay!

13:50.610 --> 13:51.700
Good.

13:52.580 --> 13:55.150
Dee! Let's play!

13:55.150 --> 14:00.800
I know animals are fond of her, but I 
can't believe she befriended a sky tiger.

14:01.280 --> 14:05.200
Perhaps she has some kind of special power.

14:17.580 --> 14:19.080
Wow!

14:19.500 --> 14:21.040
<i>What a splendid building.</i>

14:21.040 --> 14:22.500
<i>And so many people!</i>

14:24.510 --> 14:27.930
<i>I've never been anywhere other
than home and the castle!</i>

14:28.460 --> 14:33.480
<i>I'm here today to observe my 
brother and sister at school.</i>

14:34.190 --> 14:36.440
<i>I wonder if there are any rare animals here!</i>

14:34.930 --> 14:36.880
Neema? Neema.

14:37.120 --> 14:39.710
Don't do what you did the other day.

14:39.710 --> 14:41.320
Here. Take my hand.

14:41.320 --> 14:42.630
Okay!

14:45.550 --> 14:49.490
Welcome, Duke Osphe. Have a seat.

14:49.940 --> 14:51.670
Would you like some tea?

14:52.160 --> 14:54.010
<i>This is part of our school visit?</i>

14:54.010 --> 14:55.440
<i>How refined!</i>

15:00.490 --> 15:02.470
It's like we're not at school!

15:02.770 --> 15:06.960
It's all the product of 
several teachers' magic.

15:06.960 --> 15:07.670
See that?

15:08.150 --> 15:11.130
They command those soldiers 
and battle one another.

15:11.130 --> 15:12.350
Wow.

15:12.350 --> 15:14.360
<i>Is it like chess?</i>

15:14.860 --> 15:16.410
Next group, step forward.

15:17.250 --> 15:18.930
Ralfreed Osphe.

15:18.930 --> 15:20.640
<i>It's my brother!</i>

15:20.920 --> 15:24.010
He looks tough. Will Ralf be okay?

15:24.010 --> 15:25.320
We'll see.

15:26.200 --> 15:27.680
Let the battle begin!

15:28.070 --> 15:30.660
<i>G-Good luck, Ralf!</i>

15:30.920 --> 15:32.920
Infantry, advance!

15:33.800 --> 15:35.690
Cavalry, engage them!

15:46.040 --> 15:48.580
This ends here!

15:52.190 --> 15:54.500
The winner is Ralfreed Osphe!

15:55.960 --> 15:58.560
Wow, Ralf! You're so strong!

15:59.250 --> 16:02.220
Thank you. It's because 
I had you supporting me.

16:05.690 --> 16:06.680
Neema?

16:08.070 --> 16:09.450
Gotta pee.

16:14.320 --> 16:16.100
<i>I feel better!</i>

16:16.100 --> 16:18.450
Try not to lose to me.

16:17.460 --> 16:18.450
Ralf!

16:19.980 --> 16:20.910
Is this your sister?

16:21.300 --> 16:23.800
Now that she's back, I should go.

16:23.800 --> 16:27.260
Let the servants look after her.

16:27.520 --> 16:29.830
<i>What's this jerk's problem?</i>

16:29.830 --> 16:31.710
<i>Is he my brother's friend?</i>

16:32.090 --> 16:36.680
Or will she be your excuse when I beat you?

16:36.680 --> 16:38.390
<b><i>R</i></b>

16:36.680 --> 16:38.390
<b><i>A</i></b>

16:36.680 --> 16:38.390
<b><i>G</i></b>

16:36.680 --> 16:38.390
<b><i>E</i></b>

16:38.630 --> 16:41.090
Ralf is strong! He won't lose!

16:42.000 --> 16:45.780
What would a mere child know?

16:45.810 --> 16:49.730
<b><i>RAGE</i></b>

16:46.950 --> 16:49.730
<i>He sneered at me!</i>

16:50.010 --> 16:51.830
<i>They may be school friends,</i>

16:51.830 --> 16:56.190
<i>but how dare he speak that way to the ducal
family at the head of the line for the throne?!</i>

16:57.510 --> 17:00.530
Better than being a dummy 
who doesn't know his place!

17:02.800 --> 17:05.430
<i>O-Oops. I got carried away.</i>

17:06.220 --> 17:08.420
You little brat!

17:08.420 --> 17:09.050
Tristan!

17:09.050 --> 17:10.420
What are you doing?

17:11.630 --> 17:13.210
Y-Your Highness?!

17:15.520 --> 17:18.440
Raise your heads. More importantly,

17:18.790 --> 17:22.380
I thought I saw Tristan Disdall 
raise a hand against a child.

17:23.490 --> 17:25.570
I-I would never!

17:25.810 --> 17:28.400
Then why is Nefertima hiding?

17:29.620 --> 17:33.280
<i>Because I don't want to get 
caught by Prince Brute.</i>

17:33.700 --> 17:36.650
Your Highness, you know Neema?

17:36.650 --> 17:40.680
Yes. I helped her previously when 
she was lost at the palace.

17:41.370 --> 17:42.940
I wasn't lost!

17:43.330 --> 17:46.170
Oh? Ever the amusing girl.

17:46.730 --> 17:48.520
Would you like to become my plaything?

17:49.070 --> 17:50.110
No!

17:50.630 --> 17:54.240
You could come and go from 
the palace whenever you want.

17:54.830 --> 17:57.150
<i>Wh-Whenever I want?</i>

17:58.640 --> 17:59.550
<b>Fluffy Paradise!</b>

18:02.190 --> 18:07.490
F-Forgive me, but surely you shouldn't
give a child free reign of the palace.

18:07.720 --> 18:10.980
My father likes her. It won't be an issue.

18:10.980 --> 18:12.250
Mister King!

18:12.720 --> 18:15.000
You seem to like my father.

18:15.000 --> 18:16.700
Why do you run from me?

18:17.020 --> 18:18.490
Because you're a brute.

18:19.170 --> 18:20.240
Oh?

18:20.680 --> 18:24.170
Are you that desperate for my attention?

18:24.170 --> 18:25.710
Y-Your Highness!

18:26.020 --> 18:30.240
I'm sorry, but my sister is presenting soon.

18:30.240 --> 18:31.890
<i>Nice save, Ralf!</i>

18:31.890 --> 18:34.250
I see. Then I'll join you.

18:35.350 --> 18:38.710
Please give Neema to me. 
I couldn't disrespect you any further.

18:38.710 --> 18:39.590
It's fine.

18:39.980 --> 18:40.940
Tristan.

18:41.470 --> 18:43.920
Nefertima is under my protection.

18:43.920 --> 18:46.220
Don't you dare do anything like that again.

18:48.340 --> 18:51.150
Yes, Your Highness! I'll be careful!

18:51.150 --> 18:52.110
Farewell!

18:56.570 --> 18:57.520
Huh?

18:57.520 --> 19:02.020
I've been wondering... Are your eyes black?

19:02.020 --> 19:02.490
Huh?

19:02.490 --> 19:05.560
<i>Oh, no! I let him get too close.</i>

19:05.560 --> 19:08.960
<i>People in this world aren't supposed 
to have black eyes, right?</i>

19:08.960 --> 19:10.780
<i>I need to fool him somehow.</i>

19:10.780 --> 19:12.560
Th-They're blue.

19:14.420 --> 19:16.170
<i>He's suspicious!</i>

19:16.170 --> 19:18.680
<i>Uh, um, what else can we talk about?</i>

19:18.680 --> 19:20.250
Nefertima, are you—

19:20.250 --> 19:21.490
Call me Neema!

19:21.490 --> 19:22.170
Neema?

19:24.040 --> 19:28.540
<i>Now that I think about it, shouldn't 
Nefertima be shortened to Nefer or Ferti?</i>

19:28.540 --> 19:31.640
<i>Why'd they have to cut out the middle?</i>

19:33.130 --> 19:35.110
Then call me Will.

19:35.620 --> 19:37.410
W-Wiw...

19:37.850 --> 19:39.120
"Wiw" is fine.

19:44.130 --> 19:45.210
Your Highness!

19:46.080 --> 19:49.920
Be at ease. Today I'm here 
as a student of the academy.

19:50.270 --> 19:54.430
And you are not my subjects, but graduates 
who can provide me with guidance.

19:54.840 --> 19:55.640
Of course.

19:57.100 --> 19:58.100
It's Karna!

19:59.810 --> 20:01.710
There's writing on the ground.

20:01.710 --> 20:05.760
Her test involves using magic to defeat 
a monster summoned by a magic circle.

20:06.000 --> 20:07.150
Oh...

20:17.470 --> 20:19.030
What is that?

20:23.490 --> 20:24.740
Karna!

20:25.020 --> 20:26.710
Is that a monster?

20:26.710 --> 20:27.440
No.

20:27.890 --> 20:30.650
It's a fire dragon... A mighty holy beast.

20:30.920 --> 20:35.120
<i>A holy beast? That's the same kind 
of special creature as Lars!</i>

20:35.120 --> 20:38.590
Impossible! Why was a fire dragon summoned?

20:38.590 --> 20:39.590
Protect the students!

20:39.970 --> 20:42.260
Is Karnadia's element fire?

20:42.260 --> 20:46.430
Her skill with fire is high,
 but her skill with water is low.

20:47.540 --> 20:48.510
She's at a disadvantage.

20:50.240 --> 20:51.930
<i>Run, Karna!</i>

20:56.580 --> 20:58.970
<i>She's smiling? She intends to fight it!</i>

21:00.390 --> 21:01.700
<i>Mama, too?</i>

21:01.700 --> 21:05.660
<i>Hold it, hold, it, hold it.
This is obviously reckless!</i>

21:08.580 --> 21:09.680
Neema!

21:13.850 --> 21:14.570
Neema!

21:16.340 --> 21:19.260
<i>I jumped without thinking!</i>

21:19.610 --> 21:22.520
<i>I'm falling!</i>

21:29.530 --> 21:32.920
<i>Something saved me just now, didn't it?</i>

21:34.110 --> 21:36.020
Thank you!

21:36.020 --> 21:37.890
Water mages, advance!

21:38.230 --> 21:40.620
<i>This is no time to be spacing out!</i>

21:42.100 --> 21:48.530
Stop!

21:43.200 --> 21:44.290
Neema?!

21:52.050 --> 21:54.490
Don't hurt him!

23:35.180 --> 23:40.010
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.180 --> 23:40.010
<b>I've Been Summoned</b>
